            "review_text": "Ross L\nSingapore, null, Singapore6 contributions\n0\nGood service , great food.\nJul 2015 • Solo\nGreat food, I've tried the wings with a special home made source and highly recommend them. The steak is good too with a great pepper source . Also tried the potatoes with peppers and cheese . Nice atmosphere, cold beer, very clean, owners speak good English. Small place but worth the visit for the food.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 15, 2015\nKimTran2611\nHello Ross,\n\nThank you for your generous comment. I hope that Beef Bar will always keep up the quality of our food and services. We will try our best to not let your expectation down the next time you come to us. Enjoy your time in Ho Chi Minh City!\nRead more\nWritten July 16, 2015\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
