            "review_text": "PF91\nPort Lincoln, Australia9 contributions\n0\nYum!\nJul 2015 • Couples\nWe went to this place because it was beautiful and clean. It is a good restaurant and we had a lovely 150g steak for 90,000 which is $4.50! \nNot too much on the menu which is good, but enough to have a choice! \nMost of the staff spoken really really food English too! Thank you x\nWritten July 4, 2015\nKimTran2611\nThanks for your kind words,\n\nAs a newly opened restaurant, we are trying to add more new dishes in the menu, but still keep up the quality of the orginial dishes. I'm sure you will find yourself more choices the next time you visit us. It is a pleasure to have you as our customer.\n\nHave a wonderful time in Saigon!\nRead more\nWritten July 14, 2015\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
